Patch 2013: optional replacement of a region of the title logo with art that is supplied separately (JSP_EX_LOGO=0 turns it off).

vp_upload_tex_slot: after level 0 of a linear BC3 texture is copied, jex_apply (new libs/video/jsp_ex_logo.h) hashes the source bytes
of a 1024 x 531/532 texture and, for the two logo layers, composites an RGBA file over a block-aligned rectangle and re-encodes only
the BC3 blocks that changed. The art is read from JSP_EX_LOGO_ART, the exe directory or the working directory; without that file
nothing is changed (the installer does not ship one). No game data is stored in the patch.

